  "name": "Chickpea Salad",
  "subtitle": "A fresh no-cook salad with herbs, tomato, harissa, and lemon",
  "description": "Toss chickpeas and crisp vegetables with herbs and a bright harissa-lemon dressing for a simple Greek-style salad.",
